&Q000781

{1 = 1-9}
1.	The @fsux{gakkul} vat, the @fsux{gakkul} vat! 
2.	The @fsux{gakkul} vat, the @fsux{lamsare} vat! 
3.	The @fsux{gakkul} vat, which puts us in a happy mood! 
4.	The @fsux{lamsare} vat, which makes the heart rejoice! 
5.	The @fsux{ugurbal} jar, glory of the house! 
6.	The @fsux{šaggub} jar, filled with beer! 
7.	The @fsux{amam} jar, which carries the beer from the @fsux{lamsare} vat! 
8.	The troughs made with @fsux{bur} grass and the pails for kneading the dough! 
9.	All the beautiful vessels are ready on their pot stands! 

{10 = 10-20}
10.	May the heart of your god be well disposed towards you! 
11.	Let the eye of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our eye, 
12.	and let the heart of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our heart! 
13.	What makes your heart feel wonderful in itself  
14.	also makes our hearts feel wonderful in themselves! 
15.	We are in a happy mood, 
16.	our hearts are joyful! 
17.	You have poured a libation over the fated brick, 
18.	and you have laid the foundations in peace and prosperity -- now may @wDN{Ninkasi} dwell with you! 
19.	She should pour beer and wine for you! 
20.	Let the pouring of the sweet liquor resound pleasantly for you! 

{21 = 21-31}
21.	In the troughs made with @fsux{bur} grass, there is sweet beer. 
22.	I will have the cupbearers, the boys and the brewers stand by. 
23.	As I spin around the lake of beer, 
24.	while feeling wonderful, feeling wonderful, 
25.	while drinking beer, 
26.	in a blissful mood, 
27.	while drinking alcohol and feeling exhilarated, 
28.	with joy in the heart and a contented liver -- my heart is a heart filled with joy! 
29.	I clothe my contented liver in a garment fit for a queen! 
30.	The heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again; 
31.	the heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again! 

{32 = 32}
32.	A …… to @wDN{Ninkasi}. 
